## CMD vs ENTRYPOINT

CMD:
- Default command
- Can be overridden

ENTRYPOINT:
- Main command
- Extra arguments are appended

## Why Docker Cache Matters

Docker stores image layers.
If only one layer changes, Docker rebuilds only that layer.
Keeping frequently changing instructions near the end of the Dockerfile makes builds much faster.

